---

## Workspace layout

The frontend lives as a separate Cargo workspace member alongside the backend:

```
/
├── backend/          (existing — transitops-backend)
│   └── src/
├── frontend/
│   ├── Cargo.toml
│   ├── index.html
│   ├── sw.js                  # Service worker (cache/offline)
│   ├── assets/
│   │   └── styles.css
│   └── src/
│       ├── main.rs
│       ├── app.rs             # Root component + context providers
│       ├── routes.rs          # Route enum + guards
│       ├── api/               # API integration layer
│       ├── store/             # Global state (reducer + contexts)
│       ├── hooks/             # Custom hooks
│       ├── offline/           # Cache, sync queue, network watcher
│       └── components/
│           ├── layout/        # Shell, Sidebar, Topbar
│           ├── common/        # Reusable primitives
│           └── views/         # One sub-module per route
└── Cargo.toml                 # Workspace root
```

