## Key patterns summary

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| State isolation | One `use_reducer` + `ContextProvider` per domain slice |
| Cross-slice reads | Each view consumes only the contexts it needs |
| Auth header | `use_auth()` hook reads token; passed to every API call |
| Loading/error | Per-slice `loading: bool` + `use_api_fetch` hook |
| Optimistic updates | Dispatch action before await; revert on error via inverse action |
| Offline reads | `cache_read` on mount; API response updates both store and cache |
| Offline writes | Try HTTP; on network failure, `SyncQueue::enqueue`, show count badge |
| Reconnect replay | `SyncQueueWorker` drains queue serially on `online` event |
| Polling | `use_poll(ms, callback)` wraps `gloo_timers::future::TimeoutFuture` in a loop |
| Routing guards | `PrivateRoute` checks `AuthState.token`; permission-level guard checks `has_permission` |
| Sensitive field display | `TransactionResponse.card_last4` arrives pre-masked from API (`****1234`); frontend never sees plaintext |
| Pagination | `use_pagination(limit)` manages offset; `PageCache.items` accumulates on load-more |

